    <briefdescription>
<para>Monte Carlo pricing engine for discrete arithmetic average price Asian. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Monte Carlo pricing engine for discrete arithmetic average price Asian options. It can use <ref refid="m_c_discrete_geometric_a_p_engine" kindref="compound">MCDiscreteGeometricAPEngine</ref> (Monte Carlo discrete arithmetic average price engine) and <ref refid="analytic_discrete_geometric_average_price_asian_engine" kindref="compound">AnalyticDiscreteGeometricAveragePriceAsianEngine</ref> (analytic discrete arithmetic average price engine) for control variation.</para><para><xrefsect id="test_1_test000089"><xreftitle>Tests</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>the correctness of the returned value is tested by reproducing results available in literature. </para></xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>    </detaileddescription>
